thor": {"steamid": "76561199017972639", "personaname": "eveundead", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/newgardenoveroldflowers/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1503, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 427, "last_played": 1775772282, "avatar": "bc343ebaffb7ad0eac315edabc8a69fd33f10fda"}, "language": "english", "review": "bandit", "timestamp_created": 1730023643, "timestamp_updated": 1730023643, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517241418361663818", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177795358", "author": {"steamid": "76561198009662092", "personaname": "Jimby", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198009662092/", "num_games_owned": 3822, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 238, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 238, "last_played": 1446345302, "avatar": "68a5f37eb6d9510fd6383e3c07ab7e7bc0fe874c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Tried really hard to like this game because it had so much hype, but at list with single player it is a snoozefest with too much difficulty scaling to enjoy the more interesting parts.", "timestamp_created": 1729966817, "timestamp_updated": 1729966817, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517495274543762207", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177500017", "author": {"steamid": "76561198299983406", "personaname": "Zangler", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zangler1/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 4860, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4842, "last_played": 1784250240, "avatar": "b58af5d31ca5b9f501a9977e3dc28623f9b3fe75"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain may be a product of its time, and with so many new and much more polished options, it might look like the average game most players would avoid to jump straight into the more flashy sequel and remake, and I don't judge them\n\nHowever, I believe there is lots of content worth experiencing here that give us a feel of old action roguelikes before the genre got so perfected with all the modern titles. For a game that fits so well the \"dated\" definition with all its flaws and antique design that today would only make for another roguelike of the bunch, I recall many moments of simply enjoying the original Risk of Rain adventure, its combat, its level design and easter eggs, or just listening to the majestic soundtrack over and over\n\nWhile I agree it's not that great, now with a sequel that completely overshadows any relevancy it retained outside of its community, and a remake that improves on everything this game is known for, I can recommend this classic with all its creativity and insanely stupid difficulty without a second thought", "timestamp_created": 1729564917, "timestamp_updated": 1769995353, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177241102", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971225844", "personaname": "Ignore Me", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971225844/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 32225, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 28993, "deck_playti